Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Random Forest Prediction of RNA m6A Sites
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Ruoshui",
    email = "314856170+water443@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts N6-methyladenosine (m6A) status for RNA sites or feature 
    tables by a trained random forest model. It uses sequence information, RNA 
    annotations and other site features return positive-class scores and 
    threshold-based labels. The fitted model and an example dataset from the 
    BIO215 practical is included.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    randomForest, 
    stats
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
